{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. Take it to destination if heavy. Do a specific task, then scan.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    />",
